{"id":"c7c40f40c78440c0","group":"16","path":"16/16-prop-nno-eff.md","title":"prop-nno-eff","display":"prop-nno-eff","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-prop-nno-eff","aliases":["16-prop-nno-eff","Natural numbers object in Eff","16-nno-eff"],"display":"prop-nno-eff","depends_on":["[[16-df-effective-topos-compat]]","[[16-df-nno]]","[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]"],"source":"Proposition6.4.1 pp.399–400 (PDF419–420); PER encoding and primitive recursion proof","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-prop-nno-eff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-prop-nno-eff</span><span>Natural numbers object in Eff</span><span>16-nno-eff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-nno-eff"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2fe9912ae5afbfad\" href=\"?note=2fe9912ae5afbfad\" title=\"16-df-effective-topos-compat\">16-df-effective-topos-compat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" href=\"?note=ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" title=\"16-df-nno\">16-df-nno</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition6.4.1 pp.399–400 (PDF419–420); PER encoding and primitive recursion proof"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\(\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2fe9912ae5afbfad\" href=\"?note=2fe9912ae5afbfad\" title=\"16-df-effective-topos-compat\">16-df-effective-topos-compat</a>；所有数值应用使用该构造所依赖的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a> 中同一可接受编号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1=(\\{*\\},\\rho_1)\">\\(1=(\\{*\\},\\rho_1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_1(*,*)=\\mathbb N\">\\(\\rho_1(*,*)=\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_N:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\rho_N:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z:\\{*\\}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(Z:\\{*\\}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 由下文定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[Z]\">\\([Z]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[S]\">\\([S]\\)</span> 是相应功能关系等价类，完整 Eff 箭头还携带下式给出的源靶标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}\">\\(\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" href=\"?note=ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" title=\"16-df-nno\">16-df-nno</a>，其中指定终对象为上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_N(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{n\\}&amp;n=m,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;n\\ne m,\\end{cases}\n&amp;\\mathbf N&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\rho_N),\\\\\nZ(*,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{0\\}&amp;n=0,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;n\\ne0,\\end{cases}\n&amp;S(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{n\\}&amp;m=n+1,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;m\\ne n+1,\\end{cases}\\\\\nz&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\mathbf N,[Z]\\rangle,\\quad s\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf N,\\mathbf N,[S]\\rangle,\n&amp;\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}(\\mathbf N,z,s)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_N(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{n\\}&amp;n=m,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;n\\ne m,\\end{cases}\n&amp;\\mathbf N&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\rho_N),\\\\\nZ(*,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{0\\}&amp;n=0,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;n\\ne0,\\end{cases}\n&amp;S(n,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{n\\}&amp;m=n+1,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;m\\ne n+1,\\end{cases}\\\\\nz&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\mathbf N,[Z]\\rangle,\\quad s\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf N,\\mathbf N,[S]\\rangle,\n&amp;\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}(\\mathbf N,z,s)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Proposition6.4.1 pp.399–400 (PDF419–420) 给出此对象。原稿一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(n)=\\{n\\}\">\\(E(n)=\\{n\\}\\)</span> 是assembly数据；经嵌入才得到本页二元PER，不能直接冒充Eff对象。零与后继严格性、外延性、单值和全定义都由常值/后继代码验证。</p>\n<p>泛性质：给全局元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:1\\to(I,\\rho)\">\\(a:1\\to(I,\\rho)\\)</span> 与功能关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[F]\">\\([F]\\)</span>，由Lemma6.2.1选其代表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_0\\in I\">\\(i_0\\in I\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(i_0,i_0)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\rho(i_0,i_0)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，再固定一个实现元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_0\\in\\rho(i_0,i_0)\">\\(m_0\\in\\rho(i_0,i_0)\\)</span>。由该引理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=[i_0]\">\\(a=[i_0]\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{(0)}=\\rho\">\\(F^{(0)}=\\rho\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{(n+1)}(i,j)=\\bigcup_k(F^{(n)}(i,k)\\wedge F(k,j))\">\\(F^{(n+1)}(i,j)=\\bigcup_k(F^{(n)}(i,k)\\wedge F(k,j))\\)</span>；关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(n,i)=\\{n\\}\\wedge F^{(n)}(i_0,i)\">\\(G(n,i)=\\{n\\}\\wedge F^{(n)}(i_0,i)\\)</span> 给递归箭头。其tracker按n原始递归；初始与递归方程由关系复合展开得到。若H也满足方程，原书pp.399–400把零点相等及递归相等的统一实现元按n原始递归组合，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash H\">\\(G\\vdash H\\)</span>；功能关系之间的单向蕴涵已给等价，所以唯一。该证明使用实际码的统一递归，并非只对每个n分别选择实现元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-effective-topos-compat","status":"resolved","id":"2fe9912ae5afbfad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-effective-topos-compat]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nno","status":"resolved","id":"ddbc8ac3dacc270e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-nno]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-effective-topos-compat","status":"resolved","id":"2fe9912ae5afbfad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{Eff}$ 采用 [[16-df-effective-topos-compat]]；所有数值应用使用该构造所依赖的 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 中同一可接受编号。$1=(\\{*\\},\\rho_1)$，$\\rho_1(*,*)=\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{Eff}$ 采用 [[16-df-effective-topos-compat]]；所有数值应用使用该构造所依赖的 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 中同一可接受编号。$1=(\\{*\\},\\rho_1)$，$\\rho_1(*,*)=\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nno","status":"resolved","id":"ddbc8ac3dacc270e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\rho_N:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$、$Z:\\{*\\}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$、$S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$ 由下文定义；$[Z]$、$[S]$ 是相应功能关系等价类，完整 Eff 箭头还携带下式给出的源靶标签。$\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}$ 采用 [[16-df-nno]]，其中指定终对象为上述 $1$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{Eff}","display":false},{"tex":"1=(\\{*\\},\\rho_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_1(*,*)=\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_N:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"Z:\\{*\\}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"[Z]","display":false},{"tex":"[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_N(n,m)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{n\\}&n=m,\\\\\\varnothing&n\\ne m,\\end{cases}\n&\\mathbf N&\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\rho_N),\\\\\nZ(*,n)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{0\\}&n=0,\\\\\\varnothing&n\\ne0,\\end{cases}\n&S(n,m)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{n\\}&m=n+1,\\\\\\varnothing&m\\ne n+1,\\end{cases}\\\\\nz&\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\mathbf N,[Z]\\rangle,\\quad s\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf N,\\mathbf N,[S]\\rangle,\n&\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}(\\mathbf N,z,s)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E(n)=\\{n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a:1\\to(I,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"[F]","display":false},{"tex":"i_0\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(i_0,i_0)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"m_0\\in\\rho(i_0,i_0)","display":false},{"tex":"a=[i_0]","display":false},{"tex":"F^{(0)}=\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"F^{(n+1)}(i,j)=\\bigcup_k(F^{(n)}(i,k)\\wedge F(k,j))","display":false},{"tex":"G(n,i)=\\{n\\}\\wedge F^{(n)}(i_0,i)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash H","display":false}],"bytes":2506,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-397","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-prop-nno-eff|prop-nno-eff]]"},{"id":"40fee94342fc09ce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf N$ 使用 [[16-prop-nno-eff]] 的自然数PER对象；$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 使用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]。设 $D=\\{0,1\\}$、$E_D(d)=\\{d\\}$，$\\mathbf2=F(D,E_D)$。$b_0:1\\rightarrowtail\\mathbf2$ 是元素0诱导的单态（其图关系在该嵌入中给出）。"},{"id":"327ec39cab3aa293","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf N,z,s$ 是 [[16-prop-nno-eff]] 正式构造的同一Eff对象与态射；$\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}$ 采用该页引用的完整泛性质。"},{"id":"c84f27165609eabd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf N=F(\\mathbb N,n\\mapsto\\{n\\})$、$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 使用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]，等同于 [[16-prop-nno-eff]] 的二元PER对象。$\\varphi_e$ 为 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 已固定的同一可接受编号。"}],"outgoing":["2fe9912ae5afbfad","ddbc8ac3dacc270e","e3665c73100cecbb"]}